  "red_answers": [
    {
      "page": 7,
      "text": "Rick Nielsen",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 7,
      "text": "リック・ニールセン",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 9,
      "text": "In January 1995, at 19, he joined Arsenal",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 9,
      "text": "1995年1月、19歳でアーセナルに移籍した",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 11,
      "text": "CANNOTANSWER",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 12,
      "text": "回答不能（CANNOTANSWER）",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 32,
      "text": "it simply showed her what was possible with the fantasy genre.",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 33,
      "text": "ファンタジーというジャンルに何が可能なのかを示された",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 34,
      "text": "as were Cesar Franck,",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 35,
      "text": "セザール・フランクも同様だった",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 36,
      "text": "1980",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 36,
      "text": "1980年",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 37,
      "text": "In 2015, Martinez was hired by the MLB Network as a studio analyst",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 38,
      "text": "2015年、MLBネットワークのスタジオ解説者に起用された",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 39,
      "text": "In 1956",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 40,
      "text": "1956年",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 41,
      "text": "In Illinois, the anti-ERA activists used traditional symbols of the American housewife,",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 42,
      "text": "イリノイ州で、反対派は米国の伝統的な主婦の象徴を用いた",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 43,
      "text": "Yanni released If I Could Tell You, his first studio album in seven years.",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 43,
      "text": "7年ぶりのスタジオアルバム「If I Could Tell You」を発表した",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 44,
      "text": "It is not knowing that governs ethical actions, but feelings.",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 45,
      "text": "倫理的な行為を動かすのは知識ではなく、感情である",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 46,
      "text": "They have three adult children: two daughters and a son.",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 46,
      "text": "成人した子どもが3人いる。娘が2人、息子が1人",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 47,
      "text": "He made donations to Ron Paul's presidential campaign",
      "size": 21.0
    },
    {
      "page": 47,
      "text": "ロン・ポールの大統領選挙運動に寄付した",
      "size": 21.0
    }
  ],
